OL,3,GNEWSALower bills would not make up for
OL,4,Apylons 'blight'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to give people living near new
OL,7,Fpylons and substations money off their
OL,8,Fenergy bills would not make up for
OL,9,Fhaving to live with the new
OL,10,Finfrastructure, according to a Cumbrian
OL,11,Fcampaign group.
OL,13,FJim Donovan, from East Carlisle Against
OL,14,FPylons and Substation, said proposed
OL,15,Fnew overhead lines would "blight" views
OL,16,Fand damage house prices in his village
OL,17,Fof Scotby.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
