OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALower bills would not make up for
OL,4,Apylons 'blight'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government is introducing the Bill
OL,7,FDiscount Scheme, which will see people
OL,8,Fliving within 500m of new electricity
OL,9,Ftransmission infrastructure get
OL,10,Fdiscounts of #250 a year for 10 years.
OL,12,FThe Department for Energy Security and
OL,13,FNet Zero (DESNZ) said it was a
OL,14,F"tangible" benefit for communities
OL,15,Fhosting new pylons.
